  "description": "Colonel Sanders is the iconic, fictionalized mascot of KFC, created to represent the brand's founder. His image is used globally to symbolize the fast-food chain and its products. Understanding that he is a mascot, not a real person, is key to interpreting the meme’s humor and satire.",
